 vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,28)\">Jer 50:28</ref> + 7 t.; plural <bdbheb>הֵיכָלוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 8:14\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(28,8,14)\">Hos 8:14</ref> construct <bdbheb>הֵיכְלֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 13:22\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(23,13,22)\">Isa 13:22</ref> + 2 t.; suffix <bdbheb>הֵיכְלֵיכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Joel 4:5\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(29,4,5)\">Joel 4:5</ref> — never in Hexateuch, rarely in Samuel &amp; pre-exile prophets; especially frequently in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ki')\">Ki</lookup> Ezekiel &amp; late prophets, also Chronicles; occasionally in Psalms; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> rather seld. (royal) <highlight>palace</highlight> (so almost always in Assyrian); of Ahab <ref ref=\"1Kgs 21:1\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(11,21,1)\">1Kgs 21:1</ref>, of king of Babylon <ref ref=\"2Kgs 20:18\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(12,20,18)\">2Kgs 20:18</ref> = <ref ref=\"Isa 38:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,38,17)\">Isa 38:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 36:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,36,7)\">2Chr 36:7</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Dan 1:4\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(27,1,4)\">Dan 1:4</ref>, and plural <bdbheb>הֵיכְלֵי עֹנֶג</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 13:22\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(23,13,22)\">Isa 13:22</ref> <highlight>luxurious palaces</highlight>; at Nineveh <bdbheb>נָמוֺג</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְהַה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Nah 2:7\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(34,2,7)\">Nah 2:7</ref> not clearly defined are <bdbheb>הֵיכַל מֶלֶךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 45:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,45,16)\">Ps 45:16</ref> and <bdbheb>הֵיכְלֵי שֵׁן</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Ps 45:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,45,9)\">Ps 45:9</ref> <bdbheb>הֵיכָלוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 8:14\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(28,8,14)\">Hos 8:14</ref> (in Northern Israel); see also <bdbheb>וְהֵילִילוּ שִׁירוֺת הֵיכָל בַּיּוֺם הַהוּא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 8:3\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(30,8,3)\">Amos 8:3</ref> <highlight>and palace-songs shall be howlings in that day</highlight>; compare also (probably) of Phoenician palaces <ref ref=\"Joel 4:5\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(29,4,5)\">Joel 4:5</ref> quite general <bdbheb>הֵיכְלֵי מֶלֶךְ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Prov 30:28\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(20,30,28)\">Prov 30:28</ref>, &amp; <bdbheb>תַּבְנִית הֵיכָל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 144:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"144\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"144\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,144,12)\">Ps 144:12</ref> (simile of well-proportioned daughters); — usual term for royal palace in Hebrew is <bdbheb>בֵּית הַמֶּלֶךְ</bdbheb>, see  <bdbheb><reflink>בית</reflink></bdbheb>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> of palace of God considered as king, = <highlight>house of God</highlight> or <highlight>of</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, <highlight>temple</highlight> (compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 6:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,6,1)\">Isa 6:1</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> below where prophet sees <bdbheb>אדני ישֵׁב עַלכִּֿסֵּא</bdbheb>): <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> of early, pre-Solomonic house at Shiloh <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הֵיכַל י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:9\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,9)\">1Sam 1:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 3:3\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(9,3,3)\">1Sam 3:3</ref> (= <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בֵּית י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,7)\">1Sam 1:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 3:15\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(9,3,15)\">1Sam 3:15</ref> <bdbheb>פֶּתַח אֹהֶל מוֺעֵד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:22\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,22)\">1Sam 2:22</ref> omitted by <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Klo')\">Klo</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>) with doors (<bdbheb>דלתות</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"1Sam 3:15\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(9,3,15)\">1Sam 3:15</ref>) &amp; a doorpost (<bdbheb>מזוזה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:9\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,9)\">1Sam 1:9</ref>) (compare <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:7\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,7)\">2Sam 22:7</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ps 18:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,7)\">Ps 18:7</ref> <b>e</b> below). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of Solomon's temple: specifically the <highlight>hall</highlight> or <highlight>nave</highlight> of the temple (the holy place, distinguished from the <bdbheb>דְּבִּיר</bdbheb> the inner sanctuary, the Holy of Holies, and with this included in the more general term <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בֵּית י</bdbheb> or <bdbheb>הַבַּיִת</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:1\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,1)\">1Kgs 6:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:2\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,2)\">1Kgs 6:2</ref> + often) <ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:17\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,17)\">1Kgs 6:17</ref> (compare v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:19\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,19)\">1Kgs 6:19</ref> v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:20\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,20)\">1Kgs 6:20</ref> &amp; v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:2\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,2)\">1Kgs 6:2</ref>) also v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:5\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,5)\">1Kgs 6:5</ref> v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:33\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,33)\">1Kgs 6:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:50\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"50\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"50\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,50)\">1Kgs 7:50</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 4:22\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(14,4,22)\">2Chr 4:22</ref> further <ref ref=\"2Chr 4:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,4,7)\">2Chr 4:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 4:8\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(14,4,8)\">2Chr 4:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 8:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,8,16)\">Ezek 8:16</ref> (twice in verse) <bdbheb>הָאוּלָם עַלפְּֿנֵי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הֵיכַל הַבַּיִת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:3\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,3)\">1Kgs 6:3</ref> <bdbheb>אֻלָם הַהֵיכָל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:21\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,21)\">1Kgs 7:21</ref> || <bdbheb>עַלפְּֿנֵי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הַהֵיכָל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 3:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,3,17)\">2Chr 3:17</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הֵיכַל י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:16\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,16)\">2Kgs 18:16</ref> also in wide sense (apparently = <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בֵּית י</bdbheb>), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הֵיכַל י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,4)\">2Kgs 23:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 24:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,24,13)\">2Kgs 24:13</ref> (|| <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בֵּית י</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Jer 7:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,7,4)\">Jer 7:4</ref> (3 t. in verse) (|| <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בֵּית י</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Jer 7:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,7,2)\">Jer 7:2</ref>), <ref ref=\"Jer 24:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,24,1)\">Jer 24:1</ref> see also <bdbheb>נִקְמַת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הֵיכָלוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 50:28\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,28)\">Jer 50:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 51:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,11)\">Jer 51:11</ref> (both || <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נִקְמַת י</bdbheb>); <ref ref=\"2Chr 26:16\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(14,26,16)\">2Chr 26:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 27:2\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(14,27,2)\">2Chr 27:2</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:16\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,16)\">2Chr 29:16</ref> (|| <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פְּנִ֫ימָה בֵית י</bdbheb>; opposed to <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>חֲצַר ב</bdbheb>), in all three <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הֵיכַל י</bdbheb>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <highlight>hall</highlight> or <highlight>nave</highlight> of Ezekiel's temple, the holy place (see above) (included in <bdbheb>הַבַּיִת</bdbheb>, the general term embracing the whole group of buildings) <ref ref=\"Ezek 41:1\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(26,41,1)\">Ezek 41:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 41:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,41,4)\">Ezek 41:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 41:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,41,15)\">Ezek 41:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 41:21\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(26,41,21)\">Ezek 41:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 41:23\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(26,41,23)\">Ezek 41:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 41:25\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(26,41,25)\">Ezek 41:25</ref> (compare v<ref ref=\"Ezek 41:20\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(26,41,20)\">Ezek 41:20</ref>) <ref ref=\"Ezek 42:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,42,8)\">Ezek 42:8</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> general designation of 2 <highlight>nd temple</highlight>, <bdbheb>הַהֵיכָל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 8:9\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(38,8,9)\">Zech 8:9</ref> (|| <bdbheb>צְבָאוֺת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בֵּית י</bdbheb>); oftener <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הֵיכַל י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hag 2:15\" b=\"37\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(37,2,15)\">Hag 2:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hag 2:18\" b=\"37\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(37,2,18)\">Hag 2:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 6:12\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(38,6,12)\">Zech 6:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 6:13\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(38,6,13)\">Zech 6:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 6:14\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(38,6,14)\">Zech 6:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 6:15\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(38,6,15)\">Zech 6:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 3:6\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(15,3,6)\">Ezra 3:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 3:10\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(15,3,10)\">Ezra 3:10</ref>, <bdbheb>הֵיכָלוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mal 3:1\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(39,3,1)\">Mal 3:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 27:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,27,4)\">Ps 27:4</ref> <bdbheb>בּוֺנִים הֵיכָל ליהוה אֱלֹהֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 4:1\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(15,4,1)\">Ezra 4:1</ref> <bdbheb>(הַ)הֵיכָל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 6:10\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(16,6,10)\">Neh 6:10</ref> (twice in verse) (|| <bdbheb>בֵּית הָאֱלֹהִים</bdbheb>), v<ref ref=\"Neh 6:11\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(16,6,11)\">Neh 6:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 44:28\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,28)\">Isa 44:28</ref>, compare also <ref ref=\"Isa 66:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,6)\">Isa 66:6</ref>. — <bdbheb>הֵיכָל</bdbheb> occurs occasionally in Psalms, without conclusive evidence, in all cases, to what temple reference is had; apparently distinguished from <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בֵּית י</bdbheb> (as below <b>b</b>) <ref ref=\"Ps 5:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,5,8)\">Ps 5:8</ref> (<bdbheb>הֵיכַל קָדְשְׁךָ</bdbheb>; see <bdbheb>בֵּיתֶ֑ךָ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Ps 5:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,5,7)\">Ps 5:7</ref>); perhaps also <ref ref=\"Ps 68:30\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"68\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"68\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(19,68,30)\">Ps 68:30</ref> (distinguished from Holy of Holies by <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup>; yet verse obscure); but no distinction evident <ref ref=\"Ps 79:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"79\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"79\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,79,1)\">Ps 79:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 138:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"138\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"138\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,138,2)\">Ps 138:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jonah 2:5\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(32,2,5)\">Jonah 2:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jonah 2:8\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(32,2,8)\">Jonah 2:8</ref> (all <bdbheb>הֵיכַל קָדְשְׁךָ</bdbheb>); compare <bdbheb>קְדשׁ הֵיכָל֑ךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 65:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,65,5)\">Ps 65:5</ref> (|| <bdbheb>בֵּיתֶ֑ךָ</bdbheb>); as containing the worshipping assembly <ref ref=\"Ps 48:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,48,10)\">Ps 48:10</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> of the heavenly temple where <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> sits enthroned <ref ref=\"Isa 6:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,6,1)\">Isa 6:1</ref> his abode in the heavens <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:7\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,7)\">2Sam 22:7</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ps 18:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,7)\">Ps 18:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 11:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,11,4)\">Ps 11:4</ref> (|| <bdbheb>שָׁמַיִם</bdbheb>; compare <bdbheb>זְבֻל קָדְשׁוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Is